{"seq":3,"slug":"bytecode-vm","title":"字节码与虚拟机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/bytecode-vm","wordCount":1380,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"字节码与虚拟机\">字节码与虚拟机</h1><p>把一棵语法树压平成一串编号的操作码，再写一个循环逐条读取并执行——这一步看似只是换了个数据结构，却是从&quot;玩具解释器&quot;迈向&quot;生产级运行时&quot;的分水岭。CPython 的 <code>.pyc</code>、Java 的 <code>.class</code>、Lua 的预编译 chunk、WebAssembly 模块，本质都是这条字节码思路的产物。这一篇讲清楚字节码到底是什么、它为什么比树快，以及一台字节码虚拟机的骨架由哪些部件构成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>字节码是一种介于源码和机器码之间的中间表示：它是线性的（一条挨一条，不再是树）、紧凑的（每条指令是一两个字节的操作码加少量操作数）、且面向一台抽象机器而非真实 CPU。编译器一次性把 AST 降级成字节码，之后无论这段代码跑多少遍，都不必再碰那棵树。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  AST[抽象语法树] --&gt; COMP[字节码编译器]&#10;  COMP --&gt; CONST[常量池]&#10;  COMP --&gt; CODE[字节码指令流]&#10;  CODE --&gt; LOOP[解释循环]&#10;  CONST --&gt; LOOP&#10;  LOOP --&gt; FETCH[取指]&#10;  FETCH --&gt; DECODE[解码]&#10;  DECODE --&gt; EXEC[执行]&#10;  EXEC --&gt; FETCH\">flowchart TD\n  AST[抽象语法树] --&gt; COMP[字节码编译器]\n  COMP --&gt; CONST[常量池]\n  COMP --&gt; CODE[字节码指令流]\n  CODE --&gt; LOOP[解释循环]\n  CONST --&gt; LOOP\n  LOOP --&gt; FETCH[取指]\n  FETCH --&gt; DECODE[解码]\n  DECODE --&gt; EXEC[执行]\n  EXEC --&gt; FETCH</pre><p>这条&quot;取指—解码—执行&quot;的循环，就是字节码 VM 的心脏。它把 <a href=\"tree-walking\">树遍历解释器</a> 里那些散落在内存各处、靠指针串起来的节点，换成了一段连续的、缓存友好的指令数组。如何让这个循环本身跑得更快，是 <a href=\"../vm-design/instruction-dispatch\">指令分派技术</a> 的专题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-ast-到字节码-一次降级\">从 AST 到字节码：一次降级</h2><p>考虑表达式 <code>1 + 2 * 3</code>。树遍历解释器每次执行都要遍历乘法、加法、三个字面量五个节点。字节码编译器则在编译期一次性把它&quot;展开&quot;成一串栈式指令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LOAD_CONST  1      # 把常量 1 压栈&#10;LOAD_CONST  2      # 把常量 2 压栈&#10;LOAD_CONST  3      # 把常量 3 压栈&#10;BINARY_MUL         # 弹出 2、3，压入 6&#10;BINARY_ADD         # 弹出 1、6，压入 7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LOAD_CONST  1      # 把常量 1 压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LOAD_CONST  2      # 把常量 2 压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>LOAD_CONST  3      # 把常量 3 压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BINARY_MUL         # 弹出 2、3，压入 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BINARY_ADD         # 弹出 1、6，压入 7</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意指令里出现的是常量的&quot;编号&quot;而非常量本身——真正的字面量 <code>1</code>、<code>2</code>、<code>3</code> 存放在常量池中，指令只携带索引。这种&quot;指令引用常量池&quot;的分工，让指令流保持紧凑定长，也让大对象（字符串、嵌套常量）只存一份。栈式与寄存器式两种字节码形态的取舍，是 <a href=\"../vm-design/stack-register-vm\">栈式与寄存器式 VM</a> 的主题，本篇只用栈式举例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字节码-vm-的四大部件\">字节码 VM 的四大部件</h2><p>一台最小可用的字节码虚拟机由四个相互协作的部件构成。理解它们的边界，就理解了后续每一篇在补充哪个部件的细节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>由哪一篇深入</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字节码数组</td>\n<td>存放线性指令流，由程序计数器索引</td>\n<td>本篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常量池</td>\n<td>存放编译期已知的字面量与符号</td>\n<td>本篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作数栈/寄存器</td>\n<td>存放指令的临时操作数与中间结果</td>\n<td><a href=\"../vm-design/stack-register-vm\">栈式与寄存器式 VM</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用帧栈</td>\n<td>存放每次函数调用的局部变量与返回地址</td>\n<td><a href=\"../vm-design/runtime-data-structures\">运行时数据结构</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>解释循环的伪代码骨架揭示了它们如何协作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"for (;;) {&#10;    uint8_t op = code[pc++];          // 取指：从字节码数组读操作码，推进 PC&#10;    switch (op) {                      // 解码：定位到处理逻辑&#10;        case LOAD_CONST:&#10;            uint8_t idx = code[pc++];&#10;            push(constants[idx]);      // 执行：访问常量池，操作栈&#10;            break;&#10;        case BINARY_ADD:&#10;            Value b = pop(), a = pop();&#10;            push(value_add(a, b));&#10;            break;&#10;        // ...&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (;;) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> op </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[pc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 取指：从字节码数组读操作码，推进 PC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (op) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                      // 解码：定位到处理逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOAD_CONST:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[pc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">constants</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[idx]);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 执行：访问常量池，操作栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BINARY_ADD:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Value b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">value_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"为什么字节码更快\">为什么字节码更快</h2><p>把树压平成线性指令带来三重收益，叠加起来就是常见的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 提速。第一是内存局部性：指令是连续数组，CPU 的预取器和缓存对它友好，不再像遍历指针树那样频繁缓存未命中。第二是分派形态可优化：取指与分派从&quot;虚方法调用&quot;变成&quot;读字节加跳转表&quot;，可以进一步用计算跳转、尾调用等技巧压榨——见 <a href=\"../vm-design/instruction-dispatch\">指令分派技术</a>。第三是编译期一次性消解了树形结构的解析成本，重复执行不再重复付费。</p>\n<p>用 KaTeX 量化这层差异：设树遍历每节点开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{tree}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含间接分派与指针追逐），字节码每指令开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{bc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则同一表达式（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 节点对应约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条指令）的提速比近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n \\cdot c_{tree}}{n \\cdot c_{bc}} = \\frac{c_{tree}}{c_{bc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1721em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7212em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1624em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。实测中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{tree}/c_{bc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常落在 3 到 10 之间，恰好解释了经验数字的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字节码作为分发与移植的载体\">字节码作为分发与移植的载体</h2><p>字节码不只是性能优化，它还是一种工程上的&quot;接口契约&quot;。把源码编成字节码后，源码可以不再分发——<code>.pyc</code>、<code>.class</code> 文件让程序以中间形态传播。字节码面向抽象机器而非真实 CPU，所以同一份 <code>.class</code> 能在任何有 JVM 的平台上跑，移植性由 VM 而非字节码承担。</p>\n<p>更深远的是，字节码是 JIT 的天然输入。运行时收集&quot;哪些字节码序列很烫&quot;的信息，把热路径喂给 JIT 编成原生码——CPython 3.14 的 tier 2 JIT 正是工作在字节码层之上，把热的字节码 trace 用 copy-and-patch 技术翻成机器码（见 <a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.13.html\">Python 3.14 JIT 文档</a>）。字节码因此成了贯穿本 hub 后半段的主线：它既是 <a href=\"../vm-design/runtime-data-structures\">运行时数据结构</a> 操作的对象，也是 <a href=\"../jit/jit-principles\">JIT 编译原理</a> 优化的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>字节码是线性、紧凑、面向抽象机器的中间表示，由编译器一次性从 AST 降级而来。</li>\n<li>字节码 VM 的心脏是&quot;取指—解码—执行&quot;循环，四大部件为指令数组、常量池、操作数栈/寄存器、调用帧栈。</li>\n<li>指令携带常量池索引而非字面量本身，保证指令流紧凑定长、大对象只存一份。</li>\n<li>相对树遍历的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 提速来自局部性、可优化分派、编译期一次性消解结构成本三重叠加。</li>\n<li>字节码兼任分发载体与移植边界，更是 JIT 的天然输入——CPython 3.14 的 JIT 即工作在字节码之上。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此解释器基础完结。下一章 <a href=\"../vm-design/\">虚拟机设计</a> 把这台抽象机器拆开，逐一深究操作数模型、分派技术与运行时结构的工程取舍。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"字节码与虚拟机","id":"字节码与虚拟机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 AST 到字节码：一次降级","id":"从-ast-到字节码-一次降级"},{"level":2,"text":"字节码 VM 的四大部件","id":"字节码-vm-的四大部件"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么字节码更快","id":"为什么字节码更快"},{"level":2,"text":"字节码作为分发与移植的载体","id":"字节码作为分发与移植的载体"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"树遍历解释器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/tree-walking"},"next":{"title":"栈式与寄存器式 VM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/vm-design/stack-register-vm"}}